WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.520
- So, your new season
of "Vanderpump Rules",

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:03.353
what's going on?

00:00:03.353 --> 00:00:04.186
What's a tease for us?

00:00:04.186 --> 00:00:06.000
- It was so complicated, you know,

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.550
and it kind of blew up
out of the stratosphere.

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:10.440
I mean, it was just so crazy.

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:13.260
It was a lot of bad
behavior the season before.

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:14.093
- Yeah.

00:00:14.093 --> 00:00:14.926
- And we tried to sort it out,

00:00:14.926 --> 00:00:17.160
but we'd stopped filming
when it was all exposed.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:20.220
So, we need this season, this
season feels very different

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:22.740
to any other season, to sort it out.

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:25.500
And as the kind of matriarch,
do you ever watch the show?

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.150
You're looking at me like, maybe you do.

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:29.640
- No, I'm just fascinated
by everything you do.

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:32.190
I'm like, what don't you do?

00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:33.023
It's insane.

00:00:33.023 --> 00:00:34.889
- Oh, there's a couple of
things, ask my husband.

00:00:34.889 --> 00:00:38.432
(audience laughs)

00:00:38.432 --> 00:00:39.532
- Stop it.

00:00:39.532 --> 00:00:42.532
(audience clapping)

00:00:44.337 --> 00:00:46.113
- It's the British humor.

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:49.283
- I have so many jokes.

00:00:50.513 --> 00:00:52.860
They're so wasted right now.

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:54.744
God, I wish this was a nighttime show.

00:00:54.744 --> 00:00:56.490
Well, we need another commercial break.

00:00:56.490 --> 00:00:59.010
Everybody watch "Vanderpump
Rules" Tuesdays on Bravo

00:00:59.010 --> 00:01:00.260
and streaming on Peacock.

